  "translatedBlocks": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e57f4a4471032e36",
      "translationZh": "嗨！我是 MoEspresso 的作者，这是我检验自己对推理引擎想法的一种方式。乐趣在于尝试不同的设计选择，观察结果，并发现其中几个能很好地协同工作。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "037c3ec689c5c35e",
      "translationZh": "MoEspresso 3 在配备 32 GB 统一内存的 2021 款 M1 Max 上运行 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，每秒可解码 12-15 个 token——前提是后台没有运行其他内存密集型应用程序（例如浏览器）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f16dd0611fdf90e5",
      "translationZh": "在解码期间，已驻留在内存中的专家会获得偏差，但根据模型，两个最强的专家总是会被选中（使用默认设置）。我在这里写到了这一点：https://github.com/steadfastgaze/MoEspresso/blob/main/docs/cache_prior.md。我在阅读了 Apple 的 AFM 3 以及其背后的指令遵循剪枝工作（ https://arxiv.org/html/2501.02086v3#abstract ）后开始思考这个问题，但我后来发现了另一篇论文（ https://arxiv.org/html/2412.00099v2 ），它谈到了 Cache-Prior。预填充阶段是无偏的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735bb88f2a87ffa1",
      "translationZh": "即使默认启用了这种偏差，Qwen 3.8 Next 的得分也超过了 Opus 4.8 xhigh 以及许多其他强大的托管解决方案。可复现的 48 题设置 -> https://github.com/steadfastgaze/MoEspresso/tree/main/docs/benchmark_reproduction。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f451c1a46df76fc9",
      "translationZh": "包括编码、数据分析和数学在内的六个类别的总体得分（%）：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98c8cbb58580bb77",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 Flash（托管），中等",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d970e6e487a010",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 Flash @ MoEspresso，中等，Cache-Prior 2/2",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45e5d63973e7df02",
      "translationZh": "我使用了 Iwan Kawrakow 从 ik_llama.cpp 导出的一些格式，并通过我的 mlx-iqk 库进行 Metal 执行。此包中的大多数路由投影使用 IQ2_K，标准 MLX 或主线 llama.cpp 通常不支持它。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24241e5b3ff7c227",
      "translationZh": "KVarN K4/V4 在上下文增长时为驻留专家留出了更多内存，并且在此模型架构上以低 RMS 误差表现极佳。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "434e835a7bb4d1e2",
      "translationZh": "默认设置良好，例如当所有专家无法容纳时，自动进行 SSD 流式传输和 Cache-Prior，设置通常遵循相同的规则。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d0c07ea91967e87",
      "translationZh": "这是第三次迭代，我有更多具体的想法可以探索，包括从 Apple Silicon 上榨取更多性能，以及将引擎移植到 Linux 和 AMD 机器（如 Strix Halo）上。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9db8056fd19314c7",
      "translationZh": "安装通过 Homebrew 进行，因此执行 \"brew install steadfastgaze/tap/moespresso\"",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "425f7452fe0d269a",
      "translationZh": "代码 - https://github.com/steadfastgaze/MoEspresso 模型 - https://huggingface.co/steadfastgaze/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MoEspressoV3",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "490d864fd9096ec0",
      "translationZh": "如果您尝试了，我很想看到您的 \"moespresso speed\" 输出（一个故意设计的快速基准测试）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
